# Big video files live on a CDN (R2 / S3+CloudFront), NOT in this repo.
# GitHub Pages has a 100 MB/file hard limit and a soft ~1 GB repo budget; videos blow past both.
# The ambient loop is the ONE exception (force-added for a visible live proof) — see below.
assets/*.mp4
!assets/intro_loop.mp4

# dev-only tooling (lives in StormForge_web, never shipped to the Pages repo)
serve.py
make_web.sh
check.sh
__pycache__/
*.pyc
webdev/
archieve/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
